    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        0,
        -330
      ],
      "size": [
        760,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SceneRef → FLUX.2 Klein 9B\n\n1. On the **Scene Reference Viewer**: *Browse…* to a `.blend` or `.duf` scene (the first open converts it; Blender/Daz run minimized, then it is cached).\n2. Walk to your shot: **right-drag** to look, hold **right + WASD/QE** to fly, **left-drag** orbit, **wheel** dolly, **double-click** a surface to pivot on it. Pick scene cameras or **＋ Shot** to save views.\n3. Set width/height on the viewer (the latent follows), write your prompt, **Run**.\n\nThe colour view is the reference image Klein edits into a photo. The depth / normal previews are ready for ControlNet (Qwen-Image Fun ControlNet Union, SDXL depth, ...). Turn on **all shots** for a batch of every saved shot."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## SceneRef → FLUX.2 Klein 9B\n\n1. On the **Scene Reference Viewer**: *Browse…* to a `.blend` or `.duf` scene (the first open converts it; Blender/Daz run minimized, then it is cached).\n2. Walk to your shot: **right-drag** to look, hold **right + WASD/QE** to fly, **left-drag** orbit, **wheel** dolly, **double-click** a surface to pivot on it. Pick scene cameras or **＋ Shot** to save views.\n3. Set width/height on the viewer (the latent follows), write your prompt, **Run**.\n\nThe colour view is the reference image Klein edits into a photo. The depth / normal previews are ready for ControlNet (Qwen-Image Fun ControlNet Union, SDXL depth, ...). Turn on **all shots** for a batch of every saved shot."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
